{# repo discovery report section (spec repo §10.2 / spec 09 landing matrix).

Renders newly discovered repositories under a tracked owner. This is the
``report_type=repo_new`` variant of the repo integration section, distinct from
the per-repo update section (``repo_report.j2``): there are no commits/releases,
only an owner heading and the discovered repos with their README AI analysis.

This template produces **markdown** rendered with ``autoescape=False``: the
output is later sanitized by nh3 (backend) and rehype-sanitize (frontend),
so external text (description) and trusted AI output (readme_summary/detail)
are inserted verbatim as markdown content. Literal HTML (``<details>``) stays
intact as markdown-native HTML.
#}
{% for repo in new_repos %}
### [{{ repo.name }}]({{ repo.url }})

<small>🗓️ {{ repo.discovered_at or _("Unknown") }}</small>

{% if repo.description %}> {{ repo.description }}

{% endif %}
{% if repo.readme_summary %}{{ repo.readme_summary }}

{% endif %}
{% if repo.readme_detail %}<details>
<summary>{{ _("Click to view detailed analysis") }}</summary>

{{ repo.readme_detail }}

</details>
{% endif %}
{% if not loop.last %}

---

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
